window.products.push({"id":361246,"name":"Betty Boop Leg Kick Bath Robe & Slippers Set, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hijeSRHML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This cute terry cloth bath robe features everyone's favorite Cartoon character from yesteryear; Betty Boop! the Betty Boop bath robe set includes matching Slippers, that have Betty in her classic leg kick pose. Both the Slippers and the robe fit comfortably on any body type. The sleek bath ware's soft material make winding down for the night a breeze and you will want to take comfort with Betty Boop, night after night. The robe and Slippers are both one size washable woven cotton terry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hijeSRHML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Betty Boop","source_asin":"B012W5354I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012W5354I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012W5354I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361247,"name":"Set of 4 Final Touch Grand Rock Glasses with 4 Silicone Ice Ball Moulds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VRubpZxXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Here's a new way to enjoy and relax drinking your favorite liquor. This Grand Rock Glasses with silicone ice ball is now available for you!  The shape of the glass makes rolling smooth and easy without spilling. The built-in \"rock\" at the bottom of the glass creates a natural  liquid motion increasing the nosing of aromas. A slight hand movement rolls the ice ball around the \"rock\" evenly to cool your favorite  scotch, whiskey or liquor to perfection. To create \"ice ball\", fill the silicone mold up to fill line and put into the freezer to make a  single solid ice ball that outlasts traditional ice cubes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VRubpZxXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"2PO","source_asin":"B00NAAZS18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NAAZS18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NAAZS18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361248,"name":"Nemesis Now Angel of Death Figurine 23cm Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617u8NCDYsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shrouded by a hood pulled low over their face, the only part of this Reaper that is not covered by their flowing Black robe is their unsettling, long hands. The robe drapes on the floor and pools around them. A pair of skulls sit on the right hand side, a reminder of our mortality. A pair of magnificent wings sprout from the Reapers back in perfect symmetry, rising above their head, spread as wide as the can. Cast in top quality resin before being carefully hand-painted, this Reaper is the perfect reminder that your time is fleeting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617u8NCDYsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nemesis Now","source_asin":"B004UERFN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004UERFN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004UERFN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361249,"name":"Topick Sage Green Sheer Kitchen Cafe Curtains Leaf Embroidered Voile Tiers Short Half Window Semi Sheer RV Camper Curtains Farmhouse Small Door Bathro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nVCARKX9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Fabric: Our leaf sheer curtains are made of 100% premium polyester, soft & durable and very pleasant to touch. Package includes 2 curtain panels, each measuring 26\"W & 36\"L (52\"W for pair). The farmhouse leaf embroidery with just the right amount of texture seamlessly blend with your existing decor and update your room. Light Filtering: The sheer curtains allow soft sunlight and breeze flow through while providing some privacy. Voile sheer drapes enable you to appreciate beautiful scene outside the window freely and bring aesthetic warmth to your home as a soft buffer to the outside in the day. Beautifully frame your windows and create a bright & airy effect to the room. Fine Embroidery: All edges are carefully stitched without uneven hems. 1.5'' rod pocket suits most curtain rods and makes the panels drape perfectly over your window. Delicate leaf embroidery on sheer curtains creat a refreshing, natural and elegant sense to your room, bringing unique aesthetics to your room and making it the best home decor item! Versatile Fit: The embroidered leaf sage green sheers can be hung separately or layed with other linen or blackout curtains as a top layer. Add a perfect finishing touch to your bathroom, basement, living room, bedroom, laundry room, dining room, kids room, guest room, balcony, french door, sliding glass door, hotel or office, as well as rv and camper. Easy Care: The sheer curtains are made to last due to the fine material & good workmanship, easy to hang and maintain. Machine wash in cold water in gentle circle and tumble dry in low setting. Do not bleach. Creases from packing and shipping can be pressed by light ironing or steaming. Visit Lazzzy Store and meet your ideal for various styles of window treatments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nVCARKX9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topick","source_asin":"B07X9KKBWL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X9KKBWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X9KKBWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
