window.products.push({"id":361264,"name":"DOWN UNDER Bedding Double Size Premium Australian Pure Sheep Wool Fleece Fitted Mattress Cover Pad with 15\" Deep Pocket - Woolmark Certified Bed Toppe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8100j17hVpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fleece Australian Wool Fleece: This Luxurious DOWN UNDER Bedding Wool Mattress Pad is made of Australian Wool Fleece. As we all know Australia is the world-leading producer of the finest wool and the products made from them are superior quality. It is easy to carry and store since they are thinner and lighter. It gives an extra layer of softness and warmth to your bed making you more comfortable and therefore leading to a better night's sleep. Designed In Australia: DOWN UNDER Bedding Wool Mattress Topper is Designed in Australia by sleeping experts and Made in China. It fits much like a fitted sheet up to 15\" or 38.1 cm high mattress, and won’t shift throughout the night. It also helps in reducing the unwanted noise of a mattress. It helps provide an additional layer of protection to your mattress, protects it from moisture and stains. Everybody Sleeps Differently: Are you feeling hot and sweating a lot while sleeping? Don't worry, we have a solution for you. With DOWN UNDER Bedding Wool Fleece Mattress Pad, you can enjoy good night sleeps. Wool is a natural material, it is remarkably comfortable, soft, breathable in all climates. It maintains your body temperature steady and not allow you to overheat. It helps to keep you warm in winter and cool in summer. Healthy Comfortable Sleep: Our Double Sizing 54\" X 76\" or 137.1 cm X 193 cm wool mattress pad has 0.5\" inches or 1.27 cm thick wool fleece padding on the top. It helps to maintain a lower consistent heart rate and reduces sleep disturbance also, which helps you to get more deep, regenerative sleep, which gives a real boost to your health and well-being. Soft Support & Easy Care: DOWN UNDER Bedding Wool Mattress Topper provides you soft cushioned support for extra comfort and breath-ability for a restful sleep. Do not wash this wool mattress pad. Spot clean recommended. Best to air it out on a nice sunny day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8100j17hVpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOWN UNDER","source_asin":"B082GKY325","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082GKY325","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082GKY325","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
