window.products.push({"id":361275,"name":"ARIGHTEX Super Soft Sherpa Comforter Bed Set 3D Lightweight, Fuzzy Duvet Blankets Polyester Filler Bedspreads with 2 Pillow Shams (Woodland Sloth, Ful","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pTCl-dQRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Looking for the cozy comforter set to snuggle in? If you are like most people, then you probably spend a third of your day in bed. When summed up, that makes for a huge portion of your life! Make sure you spend the time well. Life is rarely easy. The time you spend in bed should offer a cozy reprieve. However, finding the perfect comforter is actually harder than it's supposed to be. Many comforters feel itchy to the skin. Some are too thin to provide real warmth. After a long day, the last thing you need is an uncomfortable bed. The Ultra-Soft Micromink Sherpa Comforter Bed Set by ARIGHTEX offers a luxurious comfort worth coming home to. Love the feel of micromink and sherpa? Our reversible comforter offers the best of both worlds! You’ll love the buttery soft feel of the micromink fabric. And you’ll never want to leave the fluffy coziness of the faux sherpa material. Our micromink sherpa comforter is made more durable with quality stitching that keeps it from coming undone--feel free to snuggle and wrap it around you whichever way you want! Non-slip properties also allow it to hang tightly to your bed. No more waking up bare and cold. The polyester material makes it easy to maintain. Just toss it in the washer and you’ve got fresh covers again! The ARIGHTEX comforter is dense and fluffy, yet lightweight all the same. It spares you the heavy stuffiness of weightier blankets. And you’ll love how our comforter comes in unique eye-popping 3D prints and colors! Here are more reasons to love our micromink sherpa comforter set: 🛌🏻 2 pillow shams included! 🛌🏻 You won’t find other comforters with the same rich prints 🛌🏻 It comes in all sizes Let clouds cradle you to sleep. Add the Ultra-Soft Micromink Sherpa Comforter Bed Set by ARIGHTEX to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pTCl-dQRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARIGHTEX","source_asin":"B07XCJP53H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XCJP53H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XCJP53H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361276,"name":"3Pcs Air Fryer Silicone Liners 8inch Air Fryer Silicone Pot Reusable Food Grade Silicone Air Fryer Baking Tray Basket Accessories Replacement of Flamm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BrV9xVbaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍟【Heat Resistant & Food-Safe】- The air fryer silicone liners are made of safe food-grade silicone, BPA free, Non-toxic, Non-stick, scratch, abrasion, tear, dirt resistant and high-temperature heat resistant up to 428 ℉ (220℃), perfect replacement of flammable disposable parchment paper liners. Our silicone air fryer liner is reusable, will not deform or damage after hundreds of uses, it is the most valuable air fryer accessory. 🍟【Perfect Fits All 3.6QT- 6.8QT Air Fryer】- The diameter of air fryer liners silicone: 8inch, height: 2inch. Suitable for 8inch baking tray basket and above and all 3.6-4.2-6.8QT air fryers, compatible with Gourmia, Ninja, Phillips, Nuwave, Gowise, Dash, Cozyna, Cosori, Ultrean, Vremi, power XL air fryer. This air fryer oven accessories can also be used in oven,microwave, pressure cooker or food placement. 🍟【Easy Cleaning & Dishwasher Safe】- These air fryer accessories are are very soft, flexible and non-stick, you just pour out food residues and dirt to flip it over inside-out and wash it with warm water. No more cleaning the air fryer basket, Keeps your air fryer free from food residue, grease, and grime without compromising the life span of your airfryer. Completely dishwasher safe, allowing you to avoid the trouble of hand washing. Say goodbye to sticky and burned residue! 🍟【Practical Design】- The reusable air fryer silicone pot have many raised lines, which improve the circulation of heat to fully heat the food for a more even doneness. Keep your bacon, breads, pizza, turkey, fries, buns integrity and nice look, and no effect on the taste of the food. Our silicone air fryer pot are designed with intimate handles on both sides to protect your hands from burns when removing the silicone pot. They are great kitchen air fryer accessories. 🍟【 Wide Applications 】- Reusable air fryer silicone basket (instead of parchment paper liner) is not only suitable for air fryers, but also can be used for microwave oven baking, barbecue frying, steamer lining or food placement. Suitable for everyday home kitchen baking, going out camping, friends gathering barbecues, rave parties and more. The perfect gift for your family, friends and cooking lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BrV9xVbaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buauty","source_asin":"B0C5WX6N67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5WX6N67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5WX6N67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361277,"name":"Enesco Jim Shore Heartwood Creek Pint Size Santa with Cardinal Figurine, 5.25\", Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SiOaRaydL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jim Shore’s hand-carved Heartwood Creek collectibles impart a sense of hope and nostalgia, embracing inspiring themes of family, tradition, spirituality, and patriotism. Small in stature, big on cheer! Handcrafted and hand-painted in brilliant red and white, this 5. 25” Pint-Size Santa is having a joyful conversation with his cardinal friend. Intricate rosemaling motifs lend a charming folk art finish to his traditional robes. This piece is sculpted from high-quality stone resin for a lifetime of love. It makes a beautiful and affordable gift for someone who sparks your joy. About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Gregg Gift, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SiOaRaydL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B078TR2MYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078TR2MYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078TR2MYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361278,"name":"Antoni Barcelona Balloon Gin Cocktail Glasses 21Oz Sagrada Familia Set 2 Hand Painted Unique Presents Gifts Women Men Mother Stained Artistic Gaudi Lo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zxngK0VFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HANDBLOWN: Each of the Antoni Barcelona wine glass is handmade and mouth-blown by highly experienced glass artisans, making each glass a unique work of art. These wine glasses exude the essence of life, adding a new dimension to the taste of your favorite red wine or white wine. UNIQUE WINE GIFT: Birthdays, anniversaries, Christmas, retirements, engagements, weddings, no matter the special occasion, these crystal wine glasses make for an excellent present. These colorful, unique wine glasses are also a fantastic gift for women and wine lovers. INSPIRED BY SAGRADA FAMILIA: As you hold the stem of these hand painted wine glasses, you will see the mesmerizing colorful patterns of the Sagrada Familia Cathedral, brought to life in your hand. Observe closely and you will see the artists' brush strokes on the stained glass. ALL OCCASIONS: Whether you are hosting a wine tasting party or planning a romantic evening with your girlfriend or loved one, these luxurious wine glasses are perfect for every moment. Impress your guests with these mouth-blown etched decorated glasses. 100% LEAD-FREE: At 21 Oz, the Antoni Barcelona glassware is large, 100% lead-free and manufactured with eco-friendly practices. Each colored wine glass comes packaged with an elegant gift box set, adding an extra layer of opulence and luxury to your fine dining experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zxngK0VFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antoni Barcelona","source_asin":"B07NPPMD9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361278","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NPPMD9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NPPMD9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
