window.products.push({"id":361282,"name":"DIY HOME Bacon Grease Container with Strainer,1.8L Oil Container Kitchen 304 Stainless Steel Oil Strainer Pot Oil Storage Can with Dust-proof lid and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qa-zxV+LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BACON GREASE MAKES EVERYTHING BETTER--From cooking eggs to flipping pancakes, you can’t deny that bacon grease adds that flavorful special touch. You can now enjoy that old fashioned magic taste of bacon grease for breakfast, lunch, and dinner every day, and you can add bacon flavor to whatever you want!You will never waste your extra bacon grease again from now on. Our oil container help you save money. FOOD GRADE MATERIAL OIL POT--The grease pot and all the accessories are made of premium SUS304 stainless steel, a kind of healthy food grade material, which will prevent the grease canister from rusting.It is high temperature resistance, corrosion resistance,and easy to clean. It can also be directly heated, compatible with open flames, induction cookers, etc., very convenient. TIMELESS CLASSIC DESIGN-- The lid will stop the dust falling into the oil. A removable fine mesh strainer can filter out the residue of cooking oil, and anti-slip coaster tray will prevents oil from spilling out. The eagle mouth shaped pour spout design works well to prevent any leakage.Constructed with a curved comfortable handle that keeps your hand safe from hot grease, and a convenient pouring lip to pour melted bacon grease. Lid can be closed without removing the strainer. LARGE CAPACITY--The fully loaded capacity is 1.8L/61oz , and the optimal capacity is 1.6L/54oz.This size has proved to be the best size for grease container. Filter oil, store oil, use oil, multi-purpose, one pot to meet the daily needs of the family. Perfect to helps us solve the problem of reuse of cooked oil. MULTIFUNCTION CONTAINER--Filter and store used cooking oil, coconut oil, pan grill and bacon grease. Also can be used to store other liquid seasoning.It can even be used to filter coffee grounds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qa-zxV+LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIY HOME","source_asin":"B09RZWJJVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RZWJJVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RZWJJVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361283,"name":"BS SHELLS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kkjj7UR0L._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kkjj7UR0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJPKS4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJPKS4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJPKS4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
