window.products.push({"id":361285,"name":"CHOKIT Luxury Soft 5D Spiral Fiber Full Mattress Topper, Extra Thick Mattress Pad Cover for Back Pain Relief, Cooling Breathable Pillow Top Protector ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V5FJNVTfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁1.【Upgraded Quality & Certified STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX】: Stuffed with advanced 5D snow down alternative fill that has a ultra soft and bouncy feel. Our mattress toppers have twice the premium filling of the traditional mattress pads, which improve the texture of the bed and the quality of sleep effectively. 🎁2.【Optimum Thickness for Support】: The pillow top mattress topper offers optimum comfort, neither too thick nor thin, achieves a smart balance between softness and cushioning. Gently cushion pressure points like your hip, back and shoulder to help relieve back pain. Provide a ergonomic support and comfort for your sleep. 🎁3.【Cool Breathable & Skin-Friendly】: With the new HNN Cooling Technology, this bed topper provides moisture wicking function and promotes greater airflow to prevent heat build-up, which keeps your skin cozy and cooling, maximizes comfort and temperature regulation for healthier sleep. Make you wake up refreshed and recovered. 🎁4.【Instantly Improve and Refresh Your Old Mattress】: If your mattress is too firm, adding our mattress topper cover is a great choice. Excellent way to restore the support of an old or a too-firm foam mattress or simply improve the softness and comfort of any mattresses. Also is an affordable upgrade for any bed instead of buying a high-cost mattress. 🎁5.【Perfect Fit and Decent Gift Idea】: The bed topper is equipped with a 360°all-around elastic skirt, perfectly fits and grips any mattress up to 22\". Available in major US sizes - Twin, Twin XL, Full, Queen, King, California King. Ideal gift for your family & friends on housewarming, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Valentine’s Day, New Year, etc. 🎁6.【Machine Washable & 100% Satisfaction】: This mattress topper is easy to clean, fully machine washable, no expensive dry cleaning necessary. Economical and sustainable. For best results, tumble dry it on low heat before use to fluff it up. If you have any problem,please contact us first.24/7 CUSTOMER SERVICE ONLINE.TRY it Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V5FJNVTfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHOKIT","source_asin":"B0B12RBCVT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B12RBCVT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B12RBCVT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
