window.products.push({"id":361326,"name":"ADORAMOUR Corner Shower Caddy Set -2 Pack Bathroom Organizer with Soap Dish, Adhesive Storage Rack for Toiletries, Shower Shelf Drill-Free or Drilling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vssscpwbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Metal Save space in small bathrooms: These shower caddies are designed to fit in the corner of your shower, which allows you to utilize space that might otherwise go unused. This is perfect for small bathrooms or those with limited storage options. The caddies are also stackable, which allows you to maximize the available space. The set comes with two caddies, so you can use one for each corner of your shower or use them in different areas of your bathroom. Easy to install: The caddies come with two different installation options, which makes it easy to find a solution that works for your bathroom. The drill-free option is perfect for smooth, flat surfaces like glass, tiled, or marble walls, while the drilling option is suitable for painted or wallpapered walls. The included manual provides step-by-step instructions, and the caddies come with all the necessary hardware for installation. Easy to clean and maintain: The caddies have a black matte finish that not only looks great but is also easy to clean. You can simply wipe them down with a damp cloth to remove any soap scum or grime. The finish also resists water spots and fingerprints, which means that they will continue to look great for years to come. Durable and sturdy: The caddies are made from high-quality materials and have a weight capacity of up to 11 Ib. The upgraded sticky hooks and expanded pasting area provide a strong and secure hold, which means that the caddies will remain in place even when they are loaded with heavy items. This makes them a reliable and long-lasting storage solution for your bathroom. Convenient access: The caddies are mounted at a convenient height, which means that you can access your toiletries without having to bend down or reach up. This makes it easier to use your items and reduces the risk of dropping them in the shower. Fast drain design: The caddies feature a fast drain design that allows water to flow through and drain away quickly. This helps to keep your items dry and clean, which reduces the risk of mold and mildew. The design also helps to prevent water from pooling in the caddies, which reduces the risk of slipping and falling in the shower. Versatile storage options: The set includes a soap holder and multiple hooks, which provides you with a range of storage options. You can use the hooks to hang loofahs, razors, or washcloths, and you can use the soap holder to keep your soap within reach. The caddies themselves can hold shampoo, conditioner, body wash, and other toiletries. The design allows you to keep your items organized and easily accessible. Versatile application: These caddies are suitable for various applications in your home, which makes them a versatile storage solution. You can use them as a bathroom organizer, shower caddy, bathtub rack, toilet paper holder, kitchen organizer, bedroom shelf, greenery hanger, or living room shelf. The design allows you to use them in any room of your home where you need additional storage space. You can even use them commercially in your spa, gym, or hotel. Ideal gift: These caddies make a great gift for anyone who wants to keep their bathroom organized and clutter-free. They are stylish, versatile, and easy to install, which makes them a hassle-free gift that anyone would appreciate. The set comes with everything needed for installation, which means that the recipient can start using them right away. Complete package: The package includes everything you need for installation, including two shower caddies, one soap tray, six sticky hooks, six expansion screws, four hooks, and a manual. The set comes with both drill-free and drilling installation options, which makes it easy to find a solution that works for your bathroom. The included sticky hooks and expansion screws are of high quality and provide a strong and secure hold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vssscpwbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ADORAMOUR","source_asin":"B09JNGHHDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JNGHHDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JNGHHDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
