window.products.push({"id":361407,"name":"Recliner Cover 4-Piece Velvet Stretch 1 Seat Reclining Sofa Couch Slipcovers Soft Plush Elastic Recliner Chair Covers Anti-Slip Washable Furniture Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XOoatUrmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【1 Seat Recliner Slipcover】MIFXIN recliner covers are upgraded designed with 4 separate parts. 4-piece stretchy recliner chair couch covers include 2 arm pieces,1 center back of seat piece and 1 center back of cover piece. Opening the recliner would be possible even with the cover on, more convenience then 1-piece whole recliner cover. Arm pieces with side pocket and each seat has two elastic loops at the back corners to be pulled through to the back of the recliner. 👍【High Quality Velvet Fabric】Our premium recliner slipcovers are crafted from luxurious velvet plush fabric, feature high stretchy and durability, extra soft and comfortable. Wrinkle-resistant and against tear polyester fabric. Slipcovers for recliner chairs constructed with thick elastic bands to cover the bottom edges well for a full protection, not easy to slip. 👍【Perfect Fit 】Our 4-piece reclining sofa covers are elastic enough to fit most standard recliner chair couch. Suitable for recliner with size: 24-37\" back width, 29-36\" height, 24-37\" bottom width, 26-34\" side width, please refer to the measurement picture before purchase. Sewn with thick elastic loops to cover the bottom edges, keep it cover sturdy on the recliner and you don’t need to adjust after sitting. 👍【Furniture Protector & Aesthetic Decor】MIFXIN recliner covers are as close to custom, can keep the shine of the recliner, color is changeable. It can not only provide daily protection for your recliner chair, save you money by extending the life of your sofa, but also transform your old recliner a new look. Dress up your furniture with our beautiful cover to add aesthetic and vibrant sense for your living room. 👍【Easy Installation & Care】4pcs separate slipcovers design, high elasticity fabric slip covers fit your recliner sofa better, can install easily and quickly in minutes. For detailed installation steps, please refer to our installation instructions. Machine washable for easy care, wash separately in cold water at gentle cycle, using mild laundry detergent, do not bleach and iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XOoatUrmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIFXIN","source_asin":"B0BV1JH5CP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV1JH5CP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV1JH5CP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
