window.products.push({"id":361627,"name":"Tablevogue 1C42128 Event Linens Washable Microfiber 4-Foot Fitted Tablecloth Cover for Rectangular Buffet Table Parties Holiday Dinner, 4-Foot, Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517HzIqbedS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At first glance, tablecloths are an unlikely place to find game-changing innovation, but Tablevogue has changed this with its line of tailored table covers. The tablecloth has been a highly valued event item for nearly 2, 000 years. Table décor coverings have not drastically changed in appearance or design since the fifteenth century – until now. Tablevogue has created an innovative product that solves several longstanding issues around tablecloth performance and design. Constructed with a patented and protected stitched corner and pleat, Tablevogue tailored, fitted table covers are made specifically to fit standard size utility folding and banquet tables without the use of clips, pins or skirts. Tablevogue tablecloths are designed for indoor and outdoor use. The modern fit looks clean and can be easily adorned to match complimentary tableware or accessories of all types. This cover’s floor length neatly disguises table legs and makes outdoor entertaining or buffet-style service a breeze. Available in a versatile array of colors, a Bali print and picnic plaid. Tablecloth is made from machine washable microfiber polyester.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517HzIqbedS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Martex","source_asin":"B083N5H1WD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361627","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083N5H1WD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083N5H1WD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361628,"name":"CafePress Simon Throw Blanket Super Soft Fleece Plush Throw Blanket, 60\"x50\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51h2VtKqRRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The perfect way to add color, pattern, and d?cor to your home. Whether on your sofa, bed, or couch; this soft and fuzzy throw is the perfect addition for any room. Warm, stylish, and most importantly comfortable. 100% superior polyester helps save your time with quick-drying and wrinkle-resistant fabric. Our soft fleece blanket will make you feel warm, cozy and relaxed. Our fleece throw is single layer, so it is lightweight, you can use it for every season. Vividly printed, this blanket is durable and designed for year-round use. Given its beautiful pattern and quality craftsmanship, this blanket makes a great gift for adults and kids on any occasion! Machine Washable: Wash separately in cold water, tumble dry low. With each washing, our blanket gets softer. Customer satisfaction is of utmost importance to us. We off easy exchanges and returns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51h2VtKqRRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B08R6LTPRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R6LTPRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R6LTPRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361629,"name":"ViViTOP Strawberry Striped Duvet Cover Twin Colorful Patterned Girls Bedding Sets 100% Cotton Bedding Collections Reversible Ultra Soft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qyA1OCHrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton Duvet Cover Set Why you need Duvet Cover? Duvet is to duvet cover as pillow is to pillowcase. A duvet cover is a protective layer that slips over the duvet and has a closure. Because duvets and comforters can be expensive and difficult to clean, duvet covers are useful because they protect your comforter during use and are easily removed and easy to wash. With duvet covers, you can also quickly and easily change the look of your bed and room without having to completely redecorate. The duvet cover also allows you to change your style or color choice of your bedding with the simple switch of the cover. This allows for easy changes from season to season. Package 3 Pieces Duvet Cover Set→1 Duvet Cover + 2 Pillowcases Size There are no COMFORTER and FITTED SHEET! Twin: duvet cover: 66 x 86 in, pillowcases: 20 x 26 in. Queen: duvet cover: 90 x 90 in, pillowcases: 20 x 26 in. King: duvet cover: 104 x 90 in, pillowcases: 20 x 36 in. Note: actual color may very from the color on your screen due to monitor color restrictions. Wash Instruction Do not bleach Do not dry clean Machine wash in cold water with similar colors","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qyA1OCHrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ViViTOP","source_asin":"B08CV787TT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CV787TT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CV787TT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361630,"name":"PiloMio by Qbedding Nature Adjustable Buckwheat Pillow | 100% Cotton Quilted Cover | Good for Relieve Muscle Tension, Neck Pain and Stress (15 inches ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Y1O4Np3AL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our Buckwheat pillows are filled with 100% Organic Buckwheat Hulls. Buckwheat pillows provide superior support to other pillows filled with down, feathers, fiberfill, foam, or memory foam. The small buckwheat hulls shift inside the pillow to match the contour of your head and neck to relieve muscle cramps, soreness, and tension, helping you wake up rested and ready to go! The hulls allow for air flow through the pillow keeping your head cool and keeping your body in balance. These pillows have been used in China for centuries and are still used today in Japan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Y1O4Np3AL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PiloMio","source_asin":"B079YXZ6XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079YXZ6XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079YXZ6XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
