window.products.push({"id":361676,"name":"Red Plaid Christmas Tree Collar: HIAGROW Christmas Tree Skirts - Christmas Tree Decoration with 17 Light Modes 41 LED Lights - Red Black Tree Collar f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k3x7ETArL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎅 【Unique Design】The red and black plaid Christmas tree collar is well integrated into the elements of Christmas，there are 41 LED lights on the edge of the tree collar (LED lights are built into the tree collar, no need to install), it has 17 kinds Colored modes for you to choose, you can have a light show at Christmas！Be prepared to receive wonderful compliments for this set up! 🎅 【High-quality material】 Our Christmas tree collar is made of high-quality cotton material, which is also very soft to the touch. Compared with linen and wood materials, it is safer and more comfortable. Children can play around the Christmas tree freely and feel the joy of the festival! 🎅【Charming Christmas Decor】Our Christmas tree collar uses two colors of red and black, which are brightly colored and full of festive atmosphere，this unique design adds infinite charm to ordinary Christmas trees, making your Christmas tree more dazzling and outstanding！ 🎅 【Suitable Size】Top Diameter: 23.6\" , Bottom Diameter: 29.5\", Height: 10.6\". Our Christmas tree collar fits most standard size Christmas tree stands. We suggest that you could measure your tree before ordering to ensure its within the collar. 🎅 【Simply Assembly】Package includes Tree collar*1, Elastic bar*2, Connecting bars*12, Battery box*1, protective gloves*2. No tool need, very easy and convenient to assemble. After Christmas, you can easily loosen the connecting rod and store the Christmas tree collar for use again next year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k3x7ETArL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIAGROW","source_asin":"B0BLCN3N6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLCN3N6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLCN3N6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361677,"name":"Formano Handheld Cooling Fan – The GENUINE Portable Air Conditioner Cooling Fan That Blows Cold Air with Ice Cooling Refrigerating Pad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q1vgpGvvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【GENUINE ICE COOLING】 Our cooling fan is like no others! With a 0.8*0.8 inch semiconductor cooling plate built in, this refrigerating pad can get super cold in just seconds! Brings down air temperature that blows through it and deliver refresh, ice cooling winds to your skin. This fan will serve as a compact, mini air conditioner that actually is portable! 【COOL DOWN IN SECONDS】This refrigerating plate can bring its temperature down in just 10s! Rub the cooling plate to your skin, it will lower your body temperature down by 36°F/20°C! Apply it to face, wrist or neck area where blood circulation is more active, it gradually cool your whole body down! The longer it (Ice Cooling Mode) operates, the colder it will get! Click the power button 3X for max wind speed, then click on the ice cooling option and you are all set, refresh your entire body in seconds. Check out more at our video! 【PORTABLE AIR CONDITIONER】Formano portable handheld fan only measures 7*3*2.4in/17.7 *7.7 *6cm, weighing 0.38lb/175g. Compact size no bigger than traditional handheld fan, can easily fit in any size of bag. The genuine portable air conditioner that you can bring around to anywhere you like. Perfect companion for outdoor activities, traveling or commuting. Cools you down and stays elegant anywhere, anytime! 【POWERFUL MOTOR & BATTERY】Our cooling handheld fan uses a 5400rpm High-Speed Motor that is powerful enough to support the blade running at a very high speed to produce strong wind. 3 levels speed optional, updated 2000 mAh battery life is between 3 to 10 hours without ice-cooling. Even with the ice-cooling function turning on, you can still use the handheld fan for up to 90 mins. (Battery life depends on speeds you choose). Type-C charging port, 2x faster charging speed. 【ELEGANT DESIGNED SUMMER GIFT】Formano personal handheld fan has a built-in cooling device that gets super cold and blows cold air at you when running. Fashionable design and practical functions make this mini handheld fan the best gift for anyone at the hot summer time! The must have item for everyone!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61q1vgpGvvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"formano","source_asin":"B09XB1ZNXT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XB1ZNXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XB1ZNXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
