window.products.push({"id":361704,"name":"NaturalAreaRugs Helena Polyester Shag Area Rug, Hand Tufted, Cotton Backing, Durable, Stain Resistant, Luxurious, Elegant, Eco-Friendly, Red (9 Feet X","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71srXczIIhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Description The Helena Shag Rug is comfortable and unassuming. Made from selected and supreme quality materials. This soft natural area rug helps us live up to our name and is ideal for those who appreciate quality. Upon closer inspection, the softest twisted yarn reveals intricate handiwork. It brings comfort and elegant style to any room. Hand-Crafted and tufted by Artisan Rug Makers from 100 percent Polyester with cotton backing. This stylish rug will bring a unique touch to any room. This rug can be handed down for centuries with the proper care and makes for a perfect addition to the living room, dining room, or bedroom. Like any rug, carpet pads are recommended as they will prolong the life of your rug, protect your hardwood floor, and keep your rug in place. Shedding may occur for the first few uses but will diminish over time. This stylish shag rug matches most modern decors. The shag pattern creates a comfortable and warm feeling on your feet. Strong construction ensures long-lasting durability and will easily accentuate any home interior design. Product Details * Product Type: Area Rug * Construction/Technique: Machine Made * Material: Polyester * Reversible: No * Primary Color: Red * Style: Contemporary * Rug Pad: Recommended (Sold Separately) * Country of Manufacturer: Imported * Crafted by: Artisan Rug Makers * Number of Item included: 1 Weights & Dimensions *Size: 9 Feet x 12 Feet (108 L x 144 W) *Length: 108 Inches *Width: 144 Inches *Height: 2 Inches *Shape: Rectangle *Product Weight: 55 Pounds","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71srXczIIhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NaturalHomeRugs","source_asin":"B00PRFF328","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PRFF328","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PRFF328","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361705,"name":"4 Piece Sofa Covers For 3 Cushion Couch Sofa Slipcover Soft Couch Cover For Dogs-Washable Sofa Furniture Covers With 3 Individual Cushion Covers, Feat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fmaeNALqS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"INDIVIDUAL CUSHION COVERS: These creative 4 PIECES sofa covers are sophisticated designed, including 1 piece of base cover and 3 individual cushion pieces. Crafted from 85% Polyester/15% spandex thicken jacquard fabric with small checks pattern. This sofa slipcover will ensure higher elasticity and is more durable than other ordinary cover for its thicken design PERFECT FIT: Our upgraded jacquard slipcovers are one-size-fits-most. It accommodates sizing variations with universal fit technology including two-way stretch fabric (T-Cushion and Box Cushion). Best fits Large Size 72 to 88-inches wide; X-Large Size 89 to 103-inches wide (outside arm to outside arm, straight across), 31 to 41-inches tall FULL PROTECTION: This slipcover is exclusive designed for sofas with individual cushions for creating a more custom-upholstered look. The cushion covers with deep elastic hems make a better fit and perfect stretch to all edges, smooth and wrinkle free. By covering cushion separately, more extra fabric can be tuck and require no re-tucking EFFORTLESS INSTALLMENT: 10 minutes to transform your room in an instant! Fast and easy installation (Installation Instructions Included). Best choice for both leather/fabric furniture, slip on and tuck the extra fabric into the gap between the back and sitting cushions. Innovate your home decor while reflecting the original shape of your furniture EASY CARE: Machine washable in cold water. Wash separately at gentle cycle. Using mild laundry detergent. Do not bleach and iron. You are welcome to shop more styles of furniture slipcovers in TURQUOIZE shop","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fmaeNALqS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Turquoize","source_asin":"B0978PW3DF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0978PW3DF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0978PW3DF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
