window.products.push({"id":361730,"name":"18 inch Metallic Balloons for Party 5 pcs Thick Latex balloons for Birthday Wedding Engagement Anniversary Christmas Festival Picnic or any Friends & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U86p1L4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BALLOONS SPECIFICATION: Metallic balloons is the classic and most popular balloons. The chrome metallic color is the upgraded version this year. We packaged 5 pcs apart for every color . It is a best choice for your different theme party. BRIGHT COLOR & STAY TIME: This chrome balloons is 18 inch gold metallic balloons . They are opaque and can be filled with air or helium. The long-lasting balloons filled with air will stay fulll for a month, while with Helium will stay for 24 hours. QUALITY & APPLICATIONS: These chrome metallic latex balloons are durable and 20% thicker than average latex balloons. They can be reused for all indoor and outdoor party decorations. Like baby shower, kids room, spring garden, graduation, summer party etc. ATTENTION & WARNING: Certain color difference occurs after Oxidation. Please DO NOT overfill the balloons and also avoid sunburn, overheat, pointed object and excessive friction. Due to automatic packing system, please understand that any holes or popped balloons within 1 or 2 pcs for one pack Balloons is a normal phenomenon. SECURITY : These party balloons are all non-toxic and eco-friendly. If you have any problem or unsatisfied, Please email to us first. We are always here for you in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U86p1L4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VUMSUM","source_asin":"B085RGV1ZV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085RGV1ZV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085RGV1ZV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361731,"name":"Mozaik M9SQP8 Plate Mosaic White Square 9.5In, 9in, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xLN+BmnpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Entertaining friends and family is a lot of fun, but when the last guest walks out the door, there’s usually an overwhelming pile of dirty dishes and wine glasses. But paper plates aren’t always sturdy, plastic cutlery can be flimsy, and while you wouldn’t want your guests sipping a delicious vintage from a red plastic cup, you also don’t want your favorite wine glasses getting broken during a particularly rowdy game of charades. Mozaik Premium Plastic Tableware offers the same versatility and convenience of ordinary disposable paper goods, but with more durability and the elevated look and feel of real plates, silverware, and glasses. Whether it’s the holidays, a birthday party, or simply a weeknight dinner with the family, you can serve a stress-free meal that feels more put together than paper plates and napkins, but doesn’t require an hour of washing dishes. Mozaik also offers a full assortment of plates, serving bowls, platters, and utensils, as well as appetizer and dessert sets that are perfect for tastings and special events. BPA-free and Kosher-Parve certified, every Mozaik piece comes with the added bonus of recyclability OR reusability – when your event is over, simply recycle your used dishes and drinkware, or hand wash them and store them for your next dinner party, event, or barbecue. There’s no need to dread post-party cleanup again – you’ll spend less time in the kitchen and more time enjoying your guests (and food!). Mozaik Premium Plastic Modern Square 9.5” Dinner Plates are ideal for events and parties with buffet-style dining. Each package contains eight plates that easily serve full size entrées with a side or two, as well as hearty entrée-size salads. Their sleek modern shape is appropriate for both outdoor events as well as chic indoor parties, and the premium plastic is so sturdy that you guests will be able to stand and mingle comfortably without worrying that their plates will bend or leak. The best part is that once your guests leave, you can either recycle the plates, or you can hand wash them for future use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xLN+BmnpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mozaik","source_asin":"B077GWJ329","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077GWJ329","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077GWJ329","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
