window.products.push({"id":361759,"name":"Sixdove Twin Size Premium 100% Waterproof Mattress Protector, Cotton Terry Surface, Ultra Soft Breathable Bed Mattress Cover, 14\"-18\" Deep Pocket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nPfZn3QfL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"➤Features: ●Cotton Terry surface+100% waterproof membrane layer: To keep our mattress protection cover cool and noiseless, the surface material is made with soft cotton terry back coated with a breathable, and 100% waterproof membrane layer. Cotton terry absorbs moisture and is completely noiseless. ●Deep Pocket: It’s especially deeper in the corners to allow stretching over a thick mattress, fitted 14\"-18\"Deep. ●Fitted Sheet Style:To ensure a great fit, an elastic band is used on the side skirt to automatically pull excess material under the mattress. ➤Application: SixDove Mattress Cover made of Cotton Terry are great for those with kids, asthma, eczema or incontinence, this mattress protector also defends against body fluids, skin flakes, and will protect your mattress from liquids and stains. ➤Available Size: SixDove waterproof mattress pad cover provides 6 different sizes. (Twin Size 39\" x 75\" - Fits up to 14\" deep mattress) (TwinXL Size 39\" x 80\" - Fits up to 14\" deep mattress) (Full  39\" x 80\" - Fits up to 14\" deep mattress) (Queen  60\" x 80\" - Fits up to 18\" deep mattress) (King  76\" x 80\" - Fits up to 18\" deep mattress) (Cal King  72\" x 84\" - Fits up to 18\" deep mattress) ➤Wash Instruction:Machine-wash with your mattress cover  using normal household detergents that do not contain bleach. Tumble dry on low heat. Do not iron.If you encounter any problems, please contact us, we will help you to solve it within 24 hours. Your satisfaction is our eternal pursuit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nPfZn3QfL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIXDOVE","source_asin":"B08TC39HND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TC39HND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TC39HND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361760,"name":"ufengkeExquisite Ceramic Porcelain Kungfu Tea Cup Set with Lid and Wooden Tea Tray-A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BNV8WOL2L._AC_.jpg","description":"About Ceramics -China China,as one of the world's most ancient civilizations,it is fair to say that ceramics history is a very important part of China's history.The word \"china\" clearly shows that the country is the \"home\" of pottery and porcelain. There are many varieties of porcelain tea sets,the main ones are: celadon tea set,white porcelain tea set,black porcelain tea set and colored porcelain.These tea sets have had a glorious page in the history of Chinese tea culture. Special Collection Function Tea set collection has existed since ancient times.It can not only realize the function of making tea, but also can be used as home decoration.At the same time, it also has certain value-added space.Under the economic conditions,many tea friends are willing to collect a few pieces of tea sets that they like.There are many kinds of tea sets for collection,and the more popular ones are porcelain tea sets and Zisha tea sets. Use & Maintenance This tea set is resistant to high temperature,wear-resistant,not easy to fade. When use the tea sets at the first time,put the teapot into clean pot with cold water and boiling for about 5-10 minutes.Then remove the pot from the boiling water and set aside for natural cooling.This step can make tea sets more clean and safety. Tea sets are pure hand-painted crafts.Available for disinfection cabinet,dishwasher and microwave oven if the tea set without colorful pattern.Not recommend to use in microwave ovens or dishwasher if the tea set with colorful pattern. There are some small flaws in the production, such as small black spots,small bubbles and so on,it's inevitable because of firing technology . Please feel free to contact us if you need personal customization, we support to do wholesale,OEM and ODM. Anyone who likes to drink tea with tea sets will love what fanquare offers.So start enjoying low tea/high tea.Click \"Add to Basket\" to get one today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BNV8WOL2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ufengke","source_asin":"B00UWCCR98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UWCCR98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UWCCR98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
