window.products.push({"id":361765,"name":"BELLOLINEA Large Whiskey Ice Ball Maker 2.54 inch Sphere Ice Cube Molds - 1 Pack(Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UddvW9MOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Impressed by the cool looking ice balls that make the drinks more interesting, better tasting as well as cold for longer period of time! You can DIY them yourself! BELLOLINEA ice molds make ice balls with distinguished details allows your drinks to stand apart and add a unique and stylish motif on it. Features: (1)Larger ice balls melt slower and release less water into a drink so they keeps your drinks cold for longer without diluting the taste. (2)Our ice sphere maker assists you on making 1 perfectly round, (2.54inch diameter) crystal clear ice balls every time. The balls can fit into any whiskey, hurricane, or wine glasses. (3)The flexible silicone enables effortless removal of perfectly globed ice balls. (4) Leaf-proof design seal the spherical ice molds properly so it won't spill as it freezes. (5) Food-grade materials are used to ensure food safety. (6) After use, you can simply put it in your dishwasher as it is dishwasher safe. Note: Freezing time: Please do not freeze in the fridge for too long. In a typical household fridge, we recommend freezing for no more than 6 hours to avoid over-freezing the puck and causing it to expand and deform. Specification: Dimension:3.39(inch)*H3.12(inch) Size of ice ball:2.54 inch in diameter Material Certifications & Tests LFGB tested: tested according to EU Regulations 1935/2004. The testing is a safety requirement that ensure, the material does not endanger human health or change the food itself. Package content: 1 x Ice Cube Maker How to make perfect ice ball: (1)Fill up the molds with water and store it in a freezer and wait for it to turn into ice. (2)To extract a perfect round crystal clear ice ball, It is suggested to let the mold sit on the sink for five minutes for the outer edges of the ice sphere to melt and be loosened easily from the mold, or pour extra water on the mold. After then, you can easily get the ice sphere out of the mold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UddvW9MOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BELLOLINEA","source_asin":"B0C39J7QKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C39J7QKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C39J7QKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
