window.products.push({"id":361791,"name":"Millvado Soup Ladle,Nylon Red Ladle With Stainless Steel Handle, Long 13 Inch Soup Ladles for Portioning and Stirring","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MB+01UwpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONVENIENT AND VERSATILE: With a capacity of 4 ounces, our versatile ladle is perfect for stirring and serving soup, chili, stews, or any saucy dish. It’s convenient and handy and you’ll find yourself turning to it all the time. FOR NONSTICK POTS: Safely scoop your soups directly from you nonstick pots without worrying about ruining the finish. With a nylon bottom, our ladle can be used in your favorite nonstick pots worry free. INTEGRATED HANGING HOLE: Not enough drawer space to store your utensils? No worries! Our soup ladle comes with an integrated hanging hole in the handle, so you can easily store it on a hook. It’ll be easily accessible whenever you need it, and the fun red color will add a touch of personality to your kitchen décor. ROUNDED STAINLESS STEEL HANDLE: Crafted from stainless steel for added durability, with an ergonomic rounded shape for ease of use, the handle of our soup ladle is durable and comfortable and will let you ladle loads of soup pain-free. DISHWASHER SAFE: When the cooking is done, simply toss your ladle into the washer and let the machine work it’s magic. Gives you more time to spend with the people you love, doing the things you love – like enjoying that delicious meal you just created.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MB+01UwpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Millvado","source_asin":"B0BSG1ZLMH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSG1ZLMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSG1ZLMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
