window.products.push({"id":361811,"name":"Duwenem Bath Tub and Shower Mat - Extra Long 38 x 14 Inch Non-Slip Bathtub Mats with Drain Holes and Suction Cups, Machine Washable TPE Bath Mat for B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610PQVZktkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY CHOOSE US: 1. TPE Bath Mat: Our bathroom mats are made of high quality TPE (Thermoplastic rubber), Free of BPA, PAHS, PAES, POFA, etc. Which has better environmental protection, resilience, slip resistance and feel than PVC plastic bathroom mats. 2. Easy to Clean: Machine washable mat bath. Simply throw the mat in your washing machine on cold with gentle detergent and air dry. 3. Perfect Design: 14 x 38 inches, fits any size bathtub or shower. More than 100 powerful suction cups ensure a firm and secure, hundreds of large-aperture drainage holes do not have to worry about water accumulation. 4. Comfort Massage Mat: The bathtub mat with round hole and texture can also be a fashion and convenient massage shower mat for kids, adult and elderly. 5. Versatile Bath Tub Mat: Our floor mat is versatile for home bathroom and it’s a perfect addition for hotels, gyms, saunas, spas, and anywhere else you need a premium baby bath mat. Not only the bath mat can be placed inside the bathtub but also outside the tub. In addition, it can also be used under the sink, in the kitchen. RECOMMENDED MEASURES: 1. It is recommended soaking the mat in a tub by warm water for 10 minutes prior to your first use to make the bath mat unfold. 2. Before using, moisten the tub with a little bit of water and aim at the center mat with suction cups on under side, applying moderate pressure to attach the suction cups onto the tub floor. 3. We recommend rinsing and drying your bathmat periodically. The bath mat should be hung up over the tub or somewhere else after use. IMPORTANT: 1. Our bath mats work on smooth, non-textured shower tub floors. Textured and tiled surfaces do not support proper suction to the surface. 2. Do not use bath oils and jump on the tub mat to avoid slipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610PQVZktkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duwenem","source_asin":"B097NZCHDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361811","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097NZCHDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097NZCHDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361812,"name":"Nemesis Now Officially Licensed KISS Glam Range Gene Simmons The Demon Tankard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dz3JiBbrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"KISS has bought monstrous pyrotechnics, iconic stage make-up and Gene Simmons’ tongue to our world since 1973! Commemorate their longevity with this expertly crafted polyresin Tankard!  Emblazoned with the face of The Demon in front of a bejewelled KISS logo, this tankard has a striking white handle, complete with black and grey logo. Guaranteed to make you Rock and Roll all night, this piece is cast in top-quality resin before being expertly hand-painted and features a removable stainless steel insert for ease of cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dz3JiBbrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nemesis Now","source_asin":"B08FTC7KNC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FTC7KNC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FTC7KNC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
