window.products.push({"id":361849,"name":"Star the Wars Canvas Wall Art (60''Wx32''H) Movie Poster Universe Spaceship Robot Battle Painting for Kids Bedroom Living Room Home Decor Stretched Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vO4osTbyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"*Product introduction: *The artist's artistic inspiration produces a stunning, top-quality visual impact on every set of work.* canvas professional stretches in a sturdy fir wood frame,with a black hook on the back of each panel that has been mounted, ready to hang. * the extra mirror edge of the canvas on each panel extends to the side to produce a first-rate 3D effect.  * each print panel is packed into a plastic bag and placed in a solid main carton for transport. *Great decoration motivates art: Home,living room,bedroom,living room,child room, school, nursery, dorm room, restaurant, office, inn,any place you want to brighten up your reflection and relaxation. *Perfect gift idea: For Thanksgiving,Halloween,Christmas,Anniversary,New Year,Mothers day,Fathers day, A ideal Valentine's Day gift,New Year gift. *Tips: 1: Our print posters are only rolled up. It does not appear on the frame. Each painting has a 4 cm white border that is used to stretch the canvas onto the screen. 2:The size of the image displayed on the page does not represent the actual size of the canvas. Please consider the actual size of the product as the specific size. Please measure your space correctly and choose the right size.Size tolerance: +/-0.39inch. 3:We make every effort to ensure that the color of the image is reproduced accurately.due to different computer monitor Settings, there may be differences between the actual canvas wall art. If there is any problem, please contact me directly and we will help you in 24 hours. * If you don't use wood frames, here are some suggestions: 1. Cut the edges. Then use a double-sided tape to attach the paint image directly to the wall, or use a thumbtack on the wall or wood. 2. Use high-strength adhesive to attach the canvas to the top and wrap the frame on a foam board of the appropriate size, then use the plate hanger and some hanging wires hanging from the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vO4osTbyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Catyendy","source_asin":"B0C1YG5Z76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1YG5Z76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1YG5Z76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":361850,"name":"Portmeirion Botanic Garden Large Airtight Canister | 8 Inch Storage Container with Sweet Pea Motif | Made in England from Fine Earthenware | Dishwashe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ksEe2Rf1L._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"In 1972, Portmeirion Founder and Designer, Susan Williams-Ellis, created one of the worlds most popular dinnerware patterns, Botanic Garden. To this day this pattern continues to grow and thrive with new flowers, colors and shapes. The pattern has many rich floral motifs usually found in English gardens and are always enhanced with an Ivy border. These designs are used throughout the extensive collection of Dinnerware, Serveware, Bakeware and Decorative items for the home. Watch your garden continue to grow with the 8.0\", 28 oz. Airtight Canister made of fine porcelain with wood lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ksEe2Rf1L._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portmeirion","source_asin":"B079MHWXPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-361850","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079MHWXPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079MHWXPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
